{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問の答え、\nゆったんがおおかったですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は......ななせまるだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあちゃんキャワユイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日もhappyな一日でしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね、皆さんのコメントも見たし、友達とも遊んだし、\nそれに........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンフレッチェ広島\nvs\nセレッソ大阪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本一を決める試合、ビッグアーチでありましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見事日本一おめでとうございますですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の誇りです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また  ビッグアーチにサンフレッチェ見に行きたくなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンフレの選手の方や、セレッソの選手の方...サポーターの皆さんの一生懸命なのが、ぶちかっこ良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（広島弁の...ぶち...ってわかりますか？）笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに...前回のはぶてるの意味は...\n「すねる」です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"問題\nQ 私がやっていた習い事は、下のうち、何個でしょう？(難しいと思うので個でいきますね)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ピアノ                  ★そろばん\n★スイミング          ★空手\n★料理教室              ★英語\n★ダンス                  ★塾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、東京では地震があったみたいですね...皆さん大丈夫ですか？\nケガはなかったですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつもまあやの事を気にかけてくれてありがとうございます\nまあやは元気です\n皆さんのコメントでパワーアップしてるよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な皆様が幸せでありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}